{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/RD_GIFT.gif?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/NSC_9.jpg?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A desolate hospital hallway - the red door waits at the end</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/NSC_11.jpg?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Her love became a curse</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/NSC_12.jpg?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Seven years of coma, two more skulls to end it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/NSC_13.jpg?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your daughter\u2019s barrier pulses with unnatural energy</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Beyond the Red Door&quot;</strong> is a gripping <strong>first-person horror experience</strong> that plunges you into a nightmare where reality and the unknown collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven years ago, a devastating <strong>car accident</strong> shattered your life\u2014your wife was lost, and your daughter has remained in a coma ever since. Haunted by guilt and grief, you find yourself trapped in a <strong>terrifying dream</strong>, standing before a <strong>massive crimson door</strong>. A voice whispers from beyond\u2014your daughter's soul is trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One night, you awaken from a <strong>disturbing dream</strong> of a massive <strong>red door</strong>, only to find yourself somewhere else\u2014<strong>a dark, twisted world</strong> beyond comprehension. You didn\u2019t mean to enter, but now you\u2019re trapped. A voice echoes in the void\u2014your daughter\u2019s soul is here, lost and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To save her, you must <strong>navigate the horrors of this nightmarish realm</strong>, unlocking its secrets while avoiding the shadows that lurk within. Armed with only a flashlight and your wits, you must <strong>survive and escape the nightmare</strong> before it consumes you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540100?t=1744693309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744693309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/263d7efe58a1d5802098d1396422e35756c311ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744693309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/263d7efe58a1d5802098d1396422e35756c311ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744693309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3540480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/RD_GIFT.gif?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/NSC_9.jpg?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A desolate hospital hallway - the red door waits at the end</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/NSC_11.jpg?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Her love became a curse</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/NSC_12.jpg?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Seven years of coma, two more skulls to end it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/NSC_13.jpg?t=1744693309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your daughter\u2019s barrier pulses with unnatural energy</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Beyond the Red Door&quot;</strong> is a gripping <strong>first-person horror experience</strong> that plunges you into a nightmare where reality and the unknown collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven years ago, a devastating <strong>car accident</strong> shattered your life\u2014your wife was lost, and your daughter has remained in a coma ever since. Haunted by guilt and grief, you find yourself trapped in a <strong>terrifying dream</strong>, standing before a <strong>massive crimson door</strong>. A voice whispers from beyond\u2014your daughter's soul is trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One night, you awaken from a <strong>disturbing dream</strong> of a massive <strong>red door</strong>, only to find yourself somewhere else\u2014<strong>a dark, twisted world</strong> beyond comprehension. You didn\u2019t mean to enter, but now you\u2019re trapped. A voice echoes in the void\u2014your daughter\u2019s soul is here, lost and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To save her, you must <strong>navigate the horrors of this nightmarish realm</strong>, unlocking its secrets while avoiding the shadows that lurk within. Armed with only a flashlight and your wits, you must <strong>survive and escape the nightmare</strong> before it consumes you.</p>","developers":["Crimson Door Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/header.jpg?t=1744693309","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126086,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126086/movie480.mp4?t=1744693308","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126086/movie_max.mp4?t=1744693308"},"name":"Red Door Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126086/8a2e836f6d5ed7e1a76de89b9163ce11bebf61cd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744693308","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126086/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744693308","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126086/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744693308"}}],"name":"Beyond the Red Door","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580 (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is strongly recommended to reduce loading times. Headphones with surround sound recommended for immersive horror experience. Ray tracing enabled for high-end GPUs (optional setting).</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><s